    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D Evaluation Framework dedicated benchmark gates (EV-BM-01..EV-BM-04). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides reproducible latency and throughput measurements for the evaluation framework Wave D operability paths.</para>
<sect1 id="bench__evaluation__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md19_1s1"><sect2 id="bench__evaluation__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md19">
<title>Benchmark families</title><para><heading level="3">EV-BM-01 — Metric computation throughput (8-thread)</heading>
</para>
<para>≥ 5 000 evals/sec</para>
<para><heading level="3">EV-BM-02 — Result aggregation latency (1000-sample batch)</heading>
</para>
<para>p99 ≤ 5 ms</para>
<para><heading level="3">EV-BM-03 — Benchmark harness invocation latency</heading>
</para>
<para>p99 ≤ 200 µs</para>
<para><heading level="3">EV-BM-04 — Judge request stub latency</heading>
</para>
<para>p99 ≤ 1 ms</para>
</sect2></sect1>
